[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 5225.39, "timestamp": "01:27:05", "text": "所以我就想"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5229.11, "timestamp": "01:27:09", "text": "嗯，我会期待的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5230.189, "timestamp": "01:27:10", "text": "很多"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5232.95, "timestamp": "01:27:12", "text": "比如，我在……上看到的那些东西"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5236.229, "timestamp": "01:27:16", "text": "互联网。这些都是真的吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5239.27, "timestamp": "01:27:19", "text": "比如便利店里卖的东西，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5241.03, "timestamp": "01:27:21", "text": "便利店省钱妙招，所有这些"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5246.149, "timestamp": "01:27:26", "text": "东西。乐队成员的薪水是多少？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5248.55, "timestamp": "01:27:28", "text": "是的，确实看到了薪水"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5251.03, "timestamp": "01:27:31", "text": "男性，日本上班族。那将是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5253.229, "timestamp": "01:27:33", "text": "我的目标之一。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5257.75, "timestamp": "01:27:37", "text": "是的，我还没有完全完成。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5260.39, "timestamp": "01:27:40", "text": "还没有遗愿清单，但我确实有一个小小的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5263.07, "timestamp": "01:27:43", "text": "心中默默记着人生愿望清单。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5264.39, "timestamp": "01:27:44", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5265.99, "timestamp": "01:27:45", "text": "我觉得你也应该喜欢你。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5268.189, "timestamp": "01:27:48", "text": "随时随地拍摄你的经历"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5271.03, "timestamp": "01:27:51", "text": "我觉得你可能也这么认为，就像你很多人一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5273.189, "timestamp": "01:27:53", "text": "观众们也会很乐意看到你点赞"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5274.87, "timestamp": "01:27:54", "text": "你知道"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5276.629, "timestamp": "01:27:56", "text": "比如你如何与新朋友互动"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 5277.818, "timestamp": "01:27:57", "author": "@dazai8348", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/FGjFKkkvDG7xMdh4VOSW06NFnlL3RtbXADws9FQ96lGBLjUzBj_TIiB